# The dynamic law for structural dynamics (Semantics R2/R3; ch. 7, "A dynamic is a sample and
# an update event"): in the tick a dynamic's update event fires, every sample reads the old
# value. A structural dynamic (a host's `$doc`, a `for`'s gathered `$(K ==> T)`) runs one tick
# behind the structure it describes: with S(n) the snapshot taken as the last act of tick n's
# construction, its value after m is S(m-1), and its update event fires at n+1 with S(n). So
# a hold sampling `$doc` on `!Updated $doc` gets the old size while the event's value has the
# new one, and a label over `Size $doc` shows the new size one tick after the structure
# changed. Written for prismc's back end. Work in progress, subject to change.
emit Ui.*
test mod Tests
use Ui.*

@child: @unit
@child:
    !add <- Ui.Button($label=$"add")                                          # 0
    $names <- {{1: "k1"}} then Insert $names, (Size $names) + 1, "k{(Size $names) + 1}" on !add
    for k, $name <- $names:                                                  # 1/[k]
        Ui.Label($text=$name)                                                 # 1/[k]/0

@host: @unit
@host:
    ((ignore, $doc)) <- @Host @child, \|p, e| @Element e              # 0/[p]/0
    $old <- 0 then Size $doc on (!Updated $doc)
    $new <- 0 then Size (!Updated $doc)
    Ui.Label($text=$"old {$old}, new {$new}")                                 # 1
    Ui.Label($text=$"size {Size $doc}")                                       # 2

# A `for`'s gathered dynamic keeps the same law.
@gathered: @unit
@gathered:
    !add <- Ui.Button($label=$"add")                                          # 0
    $names <- {{1: "one"}} then Insert $names, (Size $names) + 1, "more" on !add
    $lens <- for k, $name <- $names:                                         # 1/[k]
        Ui.Label($text=$name)                                                 # 1/[k]/0
        @ Len $name
    $old <- 0 then Size $lens on (!Updated $lens)
    $new <- 0 then Size (!Updated $lens)
    Ui.Label($text=$"old {$old}, new {$new}, size {Size $lens}")              # 2
